# 2026-10-10 — Day 3: Re-solve from blank

## P1: Top 3 merchants per month — SOLVED (no help)
- GROUP BY month, merchant -> DENSE_RANK() OVER (PARTITION BY month ORDER BY spend DESC)
- Filter rnk <= 3 in an outer query (WHERE runs before window functions)
- LIMIT cuts the whole result, not each group -> use PARTITION BY instead

## P2: Monthly spend drop > 20% — correct output, used hints
- % change = (new - old) / old. Made the "divide by current" mistake twice -> remember it.
- A drop is negative: "dropped more than 20%" = pct < -20
- First month: LAG is NULL -> pct NULL -> filtered out
- Limitation: LAG = previous month WITH DATA. A card with zero spend
  next month has no row, so attrition (100% drop) is missed.
  Fix: build a calendar of all months first.

